{"path":"types/type_index/name","title":"std::type_index::name","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::type_index::</span>name","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/type_index/name","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the name of the associated std::type_info object. Equivalent to calling std::type_info::name() directly.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> name<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the name of the associated <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\">std::type_info</a></span> object. Equivalent to calling <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info/name\">std::type_info::name()</a></span> directly.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The name of the associated <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_info\">std::type_info</a></span> object.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;typeindex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/type_index\"><span class=\"kw454\">std::<span class=\"me2\">type_index</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">typeid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>NSt3__113basic_ostreamIcNS_11char_traitsIcEEEE</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2144\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2144</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td><code>type_index::name</code> was not required to be noexcept\n</td>\n<td>required\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)"},{"path":"types/type_index","title":"std::type_index"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::type_index::name","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns the name of the associated std::type_info object. Equivalent to calling std::type_info::name() directly."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The name of the associated std::type_info object."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":80,"codeBlockCount":2}
